05/09", weight="64", tooltip="NEIRA Boys Fours,du Pont Cup: Pomfret v. BB&N, Gunn, St. Mark's, Taft			
Distance: 1500M Conditions: Tailwind, crossing tail at times. 9-11 MPH with occasional 17-21 MPH gusts. First 500 meters flatter, with some light chop thereafter. Some rain during B2 and B1 races. Comments: Alternated races with Girls. Order of Boys races: B5, B3, B4, B2, B1. Winds picked up slightly during the race day. Pomfret B2 raced down to B4 and should not be factored for NERIA seeding. 
Congratulations to Taft B1 for winning the 2026 du Pont Cup.
